# EmailJS configuration (Contact section)
# 1. Create a free account at https://www.emailjs.com/
# 2. Add an Email Service (e.g. Gmail) -> copy the Service ID
# 3. Create an Email Template with fields: name, email, subject, message -> copy the Template ID
# 4. Copy your Public Key from Account > General
#
# Then copy this file to ".env" (or ".env.local") and fill in the values below.
VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=your_service_id_here
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=your_template_id_here
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=your_public_key_here

# But if u want to deploy on vercel then obv we can't add .env to github 
# so just skip that step and add all the keys in vercel in the environment variables section before deploying.
